# OpenTofu runtime and sensitive artifacts
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl.backup
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.auto.tfvars
!**/*.auto.tfvars.example

# Generated cluster access and bootstrap material
.local/
**/kubeconfig*
**/*.private
**/*.key
**/downloaded-images/

# Local environment overrides
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
